{"id":"614758","name":"韭菜鸡蛋馅饼","author":"原来你也在这里！","authorId":"11316055","desc":"","cover":"images/614758/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"韭菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"适量"},{"name":"手抓饼","amount":"适量"},{"name":"虾皮","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"油","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"韭菜摘好，洗净晾干￼。","img":"images/614758/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"韭菜切段儿。","img":"images/614758/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"把韭菜放入盆中，放入适量的油，以减少韭菜出水分。￼","img":"images/614758/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"碗中打入鸡蛋。￼","img":"images/614758/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅中放油烧热，放入虾皮爆出香味。￼","img":"images/614758/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入蛋液炒熟。￼","img":"images/614758/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"把鸡蛋弄碎。￼","img":"images/614758/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"把鸡蛋放入碗中。￼","img":"images/614758/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入蚝油搅拌均匀。￼","img":"images/614758/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"取出手抓饼备用。￼","img":"images/614758/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"在手抓饼上放入馅儿。","img":"images/614758/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"然后把皮捏成包子状。","img":"images/614758/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"把锅烧热后放入饼，煎至两面金黄。￼","img":"images/614758/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"盛盘出锅。","img":"images/614758/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"韭菜鸡蛋馅饼就做好了。","img":"images/614758/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"非常好吃。","img":"images/614758/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"开动吧😋。","img":"images/614758/step_17.jpg"}],"tips":"这次用的馅饼皮是用手抓饼做，速度更快，也可以用传统的方法和面都是一样好吃的。￼ \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}